From b6f0bc788d5ec730752d2bbe58c73c06007b538c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Justin <justurn@live.com>
Date: Mon, 5 Oct 2026 08:33:22 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] WIP: I-382 - terrain phase reaches the minimap

- Detour the minimap terrain-tile path builder (0x7F5240): a tile the
  active phase has resolves "<phaseDir>\mapX_YY.blp" via md5translate
- Detour the minimap slot refresh (0x7F5760): one forced full reload after
  Set/ClearTerrainPhase (same-map re-enter otherwise keeps cached tiles)
- WarcraftXL_GetTerrainPhase() Lua global for the world-map overlay swap
- offsets/game/Minimap.hpp

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Sj1oBWKVaHgxBRH5t4imwS
